    <h2>Government, Exam, and Visa Upload Limits: 20KB, 50KB, and 100KB Cheat Sheet</h2>
    <p>
      Different institutional portals mandate specific size limits for applicant submissions. The table below outlines standard thresholds across international portals:
    </p>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Target Size</th>
            <th>Standard Application Requirements</th>
            <th>Recommended Format</th>
            <th>Ideal Dimensions</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>20 KB Limit</strong></td>
            <td>Digital signature uploads, thumb impression scans, bank KYC signature cards</td>
            <td>JPG (White Background)</td>
            <td>300 by 120 pixels</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
